{c='All classes',l=66,n='Major Minionskin',k='Spell',r='Rk. II - VII',e={'Caster\'s pet','Increase AC by 90','Increase Max HP by 480','Increase Current HP by 480','Increase Current HP by 240 per tick','Absorb Spell Damage: 13%','Absorb Melee Damage: 13%','Other Ancient spells','Level 60 ancient spells can be bought from Walter.','Level 65 ancient spells are quested and require a Chaos Rune, dropped by Fabled Venril Satir, Fabled Trakanon, or GoD bosses.','Level 68 ancient spells are dropped by Tier 10 raid bosses.','Generally, all detrimental ancient spells have received an additional -150 to their resist checks.','Level 70+ spells','Most spells that origially are for level 71 are available at level 70 on EQ Might.','Most spells that origially are for level 72-73 are available at level 71 on EQ Might.'},s={}},
